Recommends: fcitx5-config-qt, im-config
Description: Maatra - phonetic Marathi transliteration input method for Fcitx5
 Type Marathi phonetically on a QWERTY keyboard and get Devanagari, with a
 ranked candidate popup, sentence-context disambiguation (bigram language
 model), Devanagari digits, and per-user learning. Fully offline.
